  "release_notes_md": "## AI Data Collect v0.3.1\n\n### Multi-sensor camera zone management\nCameras with more than one image sensor \u2014 such as the Hanwha PNM-C multi-sensor\nseries \u2014 now have a **Sensor** selector in Zone Manager. Each sensor shows its own\nlive snapshot and its own detection zones and lines, so you can view, draw, rename,\nand assign roles to zones on every lens, not just the first. Single-sensor cameras\nare unchanged.\n\n### Camera support, streamlined\n- Event normalization (how incoming camera events are mapped to analytics types)\n  now ships as part of the signed camera-support data, so new camera families can\n  be added through a support-pack update rather than an application release.\n- Internal reliability and maintenance improvements to camera enrollment.\n",
